#. module: project_sprint_dashboard
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_sprint_dashboard.field_project_project__run_tag_ids
msgid ""
"Tasks with one of these tags are run work (debug, urgent, out of sprint "
"planning). A done run task without sprint is put in the sprint of its "
"closing date."
msgstr ""
"Les tâches portant l'une de ces étiquettes sont du run (debug, urgence, hors "
"planification du sprint). Une tâche run terminée sans sprint est placée dans "
"le sprint de sa date de clôture."

